# --- Plugin-derived data (never published) --------------------------------
# Your own preset library: factory presets, purchased or downloaded presets,
# and anything carrying absolute IR paths from your machine. Bring your own.
samples/*.xml
*.xml

# The generated parameter catalog. Its `observed_values` echo every string in
# your presets — including absolute IR file paths — so it stays local.
schema/morgan_schema.json

# The one exception: a preset generated BY this project from an IR-free
# template, kept as a runnable example and test fixture. Must come after the
# rules above or git keeps ignoring it.
!samples/Example_Clean_PR12.xml
!samples/.gitkeep

